
# Mission 001 — Sales Intelligence

## Project overview

This project analyzes the sales performance of NovaTech Distribution, a fictional technology distribution company operating in the United States, Canada and Mexico.

## Business objective

Transform transactional sales data into useful indicators, visualizations and business recommendations.

## Project stages

1. Business problem definition
2. Dataset generation
3. Data cleaning
4. Exploratory analysis
5. Power BI dashboard
6. SQL analysis
7. Findings and recommendations

## Tools

- Microsoft Excel
- Power Query
- Power BI
- SQL
- GitHub
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

